  "details": "Description\n\nIf you're in any sort of world on mobile, a tutorial box pops up saying, \"Tap someone to see more information and options.  Give it a try!\".  When you actually try to do what it says and tap someone, nothing happens, and the tutorial box stays and gets in the way.  \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI know of no workarounds, but if you just log into a new mobile account and join a public, you will probably find the bug.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.30201\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-21_19-12-32.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c6210de9-4bd5-4ca2-b986-8f0fa5fe7304/1/file)",
